# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quarantined Fabric template sources
#
# This project does NOT enable loom { splitEnvironmentSourceSets() }, so
# src/client is not part of any source set and would never be compiled. It is
# kept out of the repository to avoid confusing contributors with dead code.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/_unused_client_sourceSet/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit real credentials.
# mcai.json holds the API key and mcai-usage.csv holds the token history.
# In a dev environment they live under run/config/ (already ignored above);
# these entries are a safety net in case the game directory is ever redirected
# into the project folder.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
mcai.json
mcai-usage.csv
